      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for perl-DBI",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for perl-DBI fixes the following issues:\n\n- DBD::File drivers can open files from folders other than those\n  specifically passed via the f_dir attribute in the data source\n  name (DSN). [bsc#1176492, CVE-2014-10401, CVE-2014-10402]\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
